<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Become a Donor | LifeLink</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css"></head><body>
<%@ include file="partials/nav.jspf" %><main class="page wrap"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">POTENTIAL DONOR</span><h1>Register your <em>interest.</em></h1><p>This form demonstrates the proposed donor registration workflow.</p></div>
<div class="demo-alert">Prototype only: submitted information is not stored or sent anywhere. Please use fictional details for demonstration.</div>
<form class="form-panel" id="donorForm"><div class="form-grid"><label>Full name<input required maxlength="70" placeholder="Enter a sample name"></label><label>Blood group<select required><option value="">Select blood group</option><option>A+</option><option>A-</option><option>B+</option><option>B-</option><option>AB+</option><option>AB-</option><option>O+</option><option>O-</option></select></label><label>District<input required maxlength="50" placeholder="e.g. Tangail"></label><label>Availability<select required><option value="">Select availability</option><option>Available</option><option>Not available now</option><option>Contact me later</option></select></label></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" required> I understand this is a non-persistent demonstration form.</label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Submit demo registration</button><p class="form-feedback" id="feedback" aria-live="polite"></p></form>
<div class="safety-box"><b>Before real-world use</b><p>A production system would need consent, secure data storage, identity/eligibility verification, privacy controls, and a safe process for donor contact. Registration does not establish medical eligibility.</p></div></main><footer><div class="wrap footer-inner"><b>Life<span>Link</span></b><small>Student project prototype</small></div></footer>
<script>document.getElementById('donorForm').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();document.getElementById('feedback').textContent='Demo submitted successfully. No information has been saved.';e.target.reset();});</script></body></html>
